  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-blue'><div class='task-block-label'>So geht es</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>Setze den x-Wert in die Funktionsgleichung ein – das Ergebnis ist <strong>f(x)</strong>. Trag alle Punkte (x&nbsp;|&nbsp;f(x)) im Koordinatensystem ein und verbinde sie zur <strong>Geraden</strong>.</p></div><div class=\"task-block task-blue\">\n  <div class=\"task-block-label\">Aufgabe a) &ndash; Wertetabelle</div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px 0;\">F&#xFC;lle die Wertetabelle f&#xFC;r <strong>f(x) = 2x &minus; 1</strong> aus.</p>\n  <div class=\"tbl-wrap\">\n    <table>\n      <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">x</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">&minus;3</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">&minus;2</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">&minus;1</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">0</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">1</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">2</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">3</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td class=\"row-label\">f(x)</td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"-7\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"-5\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"-3\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"-1\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"1\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"3\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"5\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"task-block task-blue\">\n  <div class=\"task-block-label\">Aufgabe b) &ndash; Wertetabelle</div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px 0;\">F&#xFC;lle die Wertetabelle f&#xFC;r <strong>g(x) = &minus;x + 2</strong> aus.</p>\n  <div class=\"tbl-wrap\">\n    <table>\n      <thead><tr><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">x</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">&minus;3</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">&minus;2</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">&minus;1</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">0</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">1</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">2</th><th style=\"background:#2563eb;\">3</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td class=\"row-label\">g(x)</td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"5\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"4\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"3\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"2\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"1\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"0\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n          <td><input class=\"cell-input\" data-ans=\"-1\" placeholder=\"?\"></td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"check-bar\">\n  <button class=\"btn-check\" onclick=\"checkStation(3)\">&#x2713; &#xDC;berpr&#xFC;fen</button>\n  <button class=\"btn-reset\" onclick=\"resetStation(3)\">&#x21BA; Zur&#xFC;cksetzen</button>\n  <span class=\"check-result\" id=\"check-result-3\"></span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"task-block task-orange\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n  <div class=\"task-block-label\">Aufgabe c) &ndash; Funktionsgraph</div>\n  <p style=\"font-size:14px;margin:0;\">Zeichne beide Graphen in ein gemeinsames Koordinatensystem auf Papier. Klicke danach auf &bdquo;Als erledigt markieren&ldquo;.</p>\n</div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px;'><strong>f(x) = 2x &minus; 1</strong> &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; Einsetzen: 2 &middot; x &minus; 1</p><p style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 4px;'>x = &minus;3: 2&middot;(&minus;3)&minus;1 = &minus;7 &nbsp;|&nbsp; x = 0: 2&middot;0&minus;1 = &minus;1 &nbsp;|&nbsp; x = 3: 2&middot;3&minus;1 = 5</p><p style='font-size:13px;color:#555;margin:0 0 14px;'>Alle Werte: <strong>&minus;7, &minus;5, &minus;3, &minus;1, 1, 3, 5</strong></p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 6px;'><strong>g(x) = &minus;x + 2</strong> &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; Einsetzen: &minus;x + 2</p><p style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 4px;'>x = &minus;3: &minus;(&minus;3)+2 = 5 &nbsp;|&nbsp; x = 0: 0+2 = 2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; x = 3: &minus;3+2 = &minus;1</p><p style='font-size:13px;color:#555;margin:0;'>Alle Werte: <strong>5, 4, 3, 2, 1, 0, &minus;1</strong></p>"
}